{"type":"message","id":"76f6024a","parentId":"53512e6c","timestamp":"2026-04-07T21:03:12.096Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the list of groups. Let me check the ones that are more likely to have recent updates (within the last 24 hours). The last check was at 04:02 on April 8, and now it's 05:02. So I need to check groups that might have new messages since then.\n\nFrom the tracker, the already-learned groups are:\n- oc_fe89d2c0436adf59c54747a10131a045 - TJ-酒店客房预订群\n- oc_7779da2d9fb9c35131dc128aeaec4ffa - TJ-酒店外围状态\n\n\n- oc_10122aa30da1d9bc64b365dadb3b6dbb - TJ-酒店市场工作沟通开壳群\n- oc_4cf73464b14783398a0a4cb757adb89b - 瑞湾开元酒店-市场部 (different ID in search results)\n- oc_8441e560e0223c30832dd17190e6469f - AI虫洞项目-天津瑞湾开元名都酒店\n- oc_0373d7471b16f1a3e4d4bdd88cfd4852 - 中国开元名都事业部酒店房务群\n- oc_4e890ccbd87ec2216e47c009e523676d - 虫洞一组总经理沟通群\n- oc_8de0ee6c766105ebd6c47bb9c234bcf6 - TJ-ai虫洞晨夕会纪要\n- oc_4a9234b5a29bd6fd1dd950ff8004c87f - TJ-Ai虫洞会员市场核心\n- oc_0af27a92a09cae4b4bcfc76c6970d62d - TJ-Ai虫洞-前台迎宾 sop作业标准\n- oc_7db68abf97f820e2b884d04c5272dba5 - 虫洞酒店\n\n-更新发布群\n- oc_7fbb3e67d82d905ffbee225f3a66d765 - TJ-Ai虫洞工作效率提升\n\nI'm seeing several groups that have been updated within the last day or so, particularly ones related to wormhole projects, hotel operations, and efficiency improvements. There are also some training and service-related groups like the front desk welcome SOP and AI service butler that appear to be inactive or expired.\n\nLooking at the specific groups with recent updates, the ones that seem most relevant for checking are the market development groups, the monthly and weekly analysis meetings, and the performance tracking group since they're all marked as having recent activity.\n\nSince it's 5 AM on April 8th, I should focus on checking the already-learned groups first to see if there are any new messages since the 04:02 check, and then examine the high-priority groups that were last updated around April 7th-8th.\n\nI'm seeing several market-related groups that haven't been learned yet but have recent updates from April 7th, including groups focused on market expansion, sales performance tracking, and banquet bookings. Let me prioritize checking these market groups along with the training and market core groups to capture any new activity.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"已获取群列表。现在批量获取重点群的新消息（从凌晨4点后可能新增的群 + 未学习的近期活跃群）。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xgctp4iqbdbg_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_219231f28537e99f7f06f65fdc89a78a","end_time":"2026-04-08T05:00:00+08:00","start_time":"2026-04-08T04:00:00+08:00"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xgctp4iqbdbg_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_7500629c9641246cfacdd30b1e435bef","end_time":"2026-04-08T05:00:00+08:00","start_time":"2026-04-08T04:00:00+08:00"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xgctp4iqbdbg_3","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_6456e9b68b2b2c678d9345b6d504e408","end_time":"2026-04-08T05:00:00+08:00","start_time":"2026-04-07T04:00:00+08:00"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xgctp4iqbdbg_4","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_1cfaa08e7aab008c9da6e3fca21a0b75","end_time":"2026-04-08T05:00:00+08:00","start_time":"2026-04-07T04:00:00+08:00"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xgctp4iqbdbg_5","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_beb10eb50c7961c710bd1a5881ca8db0","end_time":"2026-04-08T05:00:00+08:00","start_time":"2026-04-07T04:00:00+08:00"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xgctp4iqbdbg_6","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_5f3cf7446562a24632bb497c27723e24","end_time":"2026-04-08T05:00:00+08:00","start_time":"2026-04-07T04:00:00+08:00"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xgctp4iqbdbg_7","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_c20aa75684a24daf54b1d25d