{"type":"message","id":"55d1045b","parentId":"4cf6b93e","timestamp":"2026-04-07T21:03:27.421Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hotel market outreach group (oc_219231f28537e99f7f06f65fdc89a78a) has an invalid container_id - maybe it's an external group? But the others returned empty, which means no new messages in the last hour (04:00-05:00) for those groups.\n\nLet me also check some other groups that were noted as potentially having content. Let me also check the already-learned groups to see if there are new messages since 04:02.\n\nActually, since all the targeted groups returned empty results (no new messages in the 04:00-05:00 window), and the market outreach group errored (probably external group), this suggests no new messages since the last check. \n \nNow I'm looking at a few more groups - the front desk SOP, the AI service lamp group, and the customer feedback sharing group - though none of these show updates in the past hour either. Since it's 5 AM local time, most of these hotel-related groups are probably inactive during these early morning hours.\n\nI'm noticing a discrepancy with the market outreach group - the search results show a different ID than what I have recorded, so I need to verify which one is correct before updating the tracker. The other groups all came back empty, which aligns with the pattern I've been seeing from the previous few hours.\n\nSince there's no new content to work with at this hour, I should update the tracker to reflect this finding and then write out the results.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"凌晨5点，几乎所有群都没有新消息。再确认几个未学习群和已学习群的最新动态。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kbd8x5rbsy0i_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_0af27a92a09cae4b4bcfc76c6970d62d","end_time":"2026-04-08T05:00:00+08:00","start_time":"2026-04-08T00:00:00+08:00"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kbd8x5rbsy0i_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get